sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend
    participant Backend
    participant External as External Service
    participant DB

    User->>Frontend: Trigger action
    Frontend->>Backend: Call API
    Backend->>External: Fetch/resolve data
    External-->>Backend: Data/Error
    Backend->>DB: Persist result
    DB-->>Backend: OK
    Backend-->>Frontend: Return response
    Frontend-->>User: Update UI

    alt Failure path
        Backend-->>Frontend: Error response
        Frontend-->>User: Show error
    end
